<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<graphml xmlns="http://graphml.graphdrawing.org/xmlns" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:schemaLocation="http://graphml.graphdrawing.org/xmlns http://graphml.graphdrawing.org/xmlns/1.0/graphml.xsd">
  <key id="d6" for="edge" attr.name="source_id" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d5" for="edge" attr.name="keywords" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d4" for="edge" attr.name="description" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d3" for="edge" attr.name="weight" attr.type="double" />
  <key id="d2" for="node" attr.name="source_id" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d1" for="node" attr.name="description" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d0" for="node" attr.name="entity_type" attr.type="string" />
  <graph edgedefault="undirected">
    <node id="&quot;KNUT KORSÆTH&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Knut Korsæth is a Norwegian politician known for his dedication to public service, social justice, education, and economic development. He received the Commander of the Order of St. Olav and the Commander of the Legion of Honour for his contributions."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0429</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;COMMANDER OF THE ORDER OF ST. OLAV&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"AWARD"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Commander of the Order of St. Olav is Norway's highest honor, awarded to individuals who have made significant contributions to the country's welfare, culture, and society."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0429</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;COMMANDER OF THE LEGION OF HONOUR&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"AWARD"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Commander of the Legion of Honour is a role within the Legion of Honour, indicating a high level of recognition."&lt;SEP&gt;"Commander of the Legion of Honour is the third highest rank in the French Legion of Honour, awarded for outstanding contributions to strengthening Franco-Norwegian relations and promoting cultural exchange."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0429</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;NORWAY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Norway is the country of origin for Korsæth and Erna Solberg, discussed in the context of international relations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Norway is the home country of Knut Korsæth and the setting of much of his political career."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0429</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;FRANCE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"France is the country where Knut Korsæth received the Commander of the Legion of Honour and where he has promoted Franco-Norwegian relations."&lt;SEP&gt;"France is the country where the Legion of Honour is based and where Korsæth is being honored."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0429</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;NORWEGIAN PARLIAMENT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Norwegian Parliament is the legislative body where Knut Korsæth served as a member since 2009."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0429</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ORDER OF ST. OLAV&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Order of St. Olav is a Norwegian order of chivalry established in 1847, recognizing individuals for their contributions to the country."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0429</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;LEGION OF HONOUR&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Legion of Honour is a French order of merit, recognizing individuals for their contributions to France and international relations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Legion of Honour is a prestigious French order of merit, recognizing significant contributions to French culture and international relations."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0429</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;NORWEGIAN MINISTRY OF FOREIGN AFFAIRS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Norwegian Ministry of Foreign Affairs provides data on bilateral trade and cultural exchange between Norway and France."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0429</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;FRANCO-NORWEGIAN RELATIONS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Franco-Norwegian relations refer to the diplomatic and cultural exchanges between Norway and France."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0429</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;NORWEGIAN-FRANCE CULTURAL EXCHANGE PROGRAM&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Norwegian-France Cultural Exchange Program is a program initiated by Knut Korsæth to promote cultural exchange between Norway and France."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0429</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;KING OLAV V&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"King Olav V is the monarch of Norway who bestowed the Commander of the Order of St. Olav upon Knut Korsæth."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0429</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;OSLO&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Oslo is the capital city of Norway where the ceremonies took place."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0429</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;FRENCH EMBASSY IN OSLO&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"French Embassy in Oslo is the venue for the ceremony where Knut Korsæth received the Commander of the Legion of Honour."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0429</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MONSIEUR PIERRE DUPONT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Monsieur Pierre Dupont is the French Ambassador to Norway who presided over the ceremony and praised Knut Korsæth's contributions."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0429</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ERNA SOLBERG&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Erna Solberg is the Norwegian Prime Minister who expressed pride in Knut Korsæth's recognition."&lt;SEP&gt;"Erna Solberg is the current Prime Minister of Norway and is discussing the strong bond between countries."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0429</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;WORLD WAR II&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"World War II is the historical event that influenced Norway's post-war reconstruction efforts, in which Knut Korsæth played a key role."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0429</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SOCIAL JUSTICE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Social Justice is one of the causes that Knut Korsæth championed throughout his political career."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0429</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;EDUCATION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Education is one of the areas where Knut Korsæth advocated for and worked to improve."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0429</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ECONOMIC DEVELOPMENT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Economic Development is another area where Knut Korsæth focused his efforts to benefit the Norwegian people."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0429</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;POST-WAR RECONSTRUCTION EFFORTS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Post-War Reconstruction Efforts are the efforts made by Norway to rebuild its infrastructure, economy, and social fabric after World War II, in which Knut Korsæth played a key role."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0429</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DIPLOMACY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Diplomacy is highlighted as a key aspect of Knut Korsæth's contributions to international relations."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0429</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BILATERAL TRADE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Bilateral Trade is the economic relationship between Norway and France, which has seen growth due to Knut Korsæth's efforts."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0429</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CULTURAL EXCHANGE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Cultural Exchange is the focus of the Norwegian-France Cultural Exchange Program and a key aspect of Knut Korsæth's contributions."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0429</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;NORWEGIAN PRIME MINISTER&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Norwegian Prime Minister is a political leader of Norway, specifically mentioned as Erna Solberg in the context of a strong bond between countries."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0429</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;KORSÆTH&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Korsæth is a person who has been appointed as Commander of the Legion of Honour, recognized for significant contributions."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0429</data>
    </node>
