      <data key="d5">"program initiation, cultural exchange"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0429</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;KNUT KORSÆTH&quot;" target="&quot;KING OLAV V&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Knut Korsæth received the Commander of the Order of St. Olav from King Olav V, a significant honor for his contributions to Norway."</data>
      <data key="d5">"recognition, honor"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0429</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;KNUT KORSÆTH&quot;" target="&quot;OSLO&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The ceremony for Knut Korsæth's Commander of the Legion of Honour took place in Oslo, highlighting the international recognition of his contributions."</data>
      <data key="d5">"ceremony, recognition"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0429</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;KNUT KORSÆTH&quot;" target="&quot;FRENCH EMBASSY IN OSLO&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The ceremony for Knut Korsæth's Commander of the Legion of Honour was held at the French Embassy in Oslo, emphasizing the international nature of his recognition."</data>
      <data key="d5">"ceremony, recognition"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0429</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;KNUT KORSÆTH&quot;" target="&quot;MONSIEUR PIERRE DUPONT&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Monsieur Pierre Dupont praised Knut Korsæth's contributions to Franco-Norwegian relations, highlighting his role in cultural exchange."</data>
      <data key="d5">"praise, recognition"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0429</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;KNUT KORSÆTH&quot;" target="&quot;ERNA SOLBERG&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Erna Solberg expressed pride in Knut Korsæth's recognition, reflecting the national pride in his contributions."</data>
      <data key="d5">"pride, recognition"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0429</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;KNUT KORSÆTH&quot;" target="&quot;WORLD WAR II&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Knut Korsæth's post-war reconstruction efforts were influenced by the challenges faced during World War II, demonstrating his commitment to recovery."</data>
      <data key="d5">"influence, recovery"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0429</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;COMMANDER OF THE LEGION OF HONOUR&quot;" target="&quot;KORSÆTH&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Korsæth holds the role of Commander of the Legion of Honour, indicating his high level of recognition and contribution."</data>
      <data key="d5">"recognition, role"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0429</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;NORWAY&quot;" target="&quot;FRANCE&quot;">
      <data key="d3">16.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Norway and France have a strong bond, as evidenced by the appointment of a Norwegian representative to the Legion of Honour."</data>
      <data key="d5">"international relations, cultural exchange"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0429</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;FRANCE&quot;" target="&quot;LEGION OF HONOUR&quot;">
      <data key="d3">18.0</data>
